<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Cell Biol</journal-id><journal-title>The Journal of Cell Biology</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0021-9525</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-8140</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2169491</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">cor</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Errata</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Correction <italic>The Journal of Cell Biology</italic></article-title></title-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>6</day><month>9</month><year>1999</year></pub-date><volume>146</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>1203</fpage><lpage>1203</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>&#x000a9; 1999 The Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement><copyright-year>1999</copyright-year><copyright-holder>The Rockefeller University Press</copyright-holder></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p>Ayscough et al. Vol. 137, No. 2, April 21, 1997. Pages 399&#x02013;416.</p><p>In <xref ref-type="fig" rid="F3">Fig. 3</xref> of this paper, two of the subdomains of actin were numbered incorrectly. A corrected black and white version of the original color figure appears below.</p></body><floats-wrap><fig position="float" id="F3"><label>Figure 3</label><graphic xlink:href="JCBCOR.f3"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>